        <body>
            <div xml:id="d446">

                <pb facs="1002" n="906" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg906"/>

                <head>No. 415.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stoughton to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-12-28"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 28, 1878</date>.
                        (Received January 20, 1879.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 63.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward to you herewith
                    military dispatch No. 21, of Lieut. F. Y. Greene, military attaché of this
                    legation.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>E. W. STOUGHTON.</signed></closer>




